{{!-- home/step.hbs — one step in "how it works".

     The design system's `.ns-feature`, which already IS icon + index + name +
     body. The theme drew the same object with an absolutely-positioned "Step
     N" pill hanging off the top edge — a second numbering vocabulary, in a
     system whose whole point is that the index is mono and lives in __top.

     Params: num, icon, title, body --}}
<article class="ns-feature">
  <div class="ns-feature__top">
    {{> icons name=icon}}
    <span class="ns-feature__num">{{num}}</span>
  </div>
  <h3 class="ns-feature__name">{{title}}</h3>
  <p class="ns-feature__text">{{body}}</p>
</article>
